<body class="setupTab" onload="init()" style="background-color: #FFFFFF; bEditID: b1st1; bLabel: body;">
<table cellpadding="0" width="500" cellspacing="0" id="topTable" height="450">
<tbody>
<tr valign="top">
<td style="background-color: #ffffff; beditid: r1st1; blabel: header; vertical-align: top; height: 95; text-align: left;"><img border="0" beditid="r1sp1" blabel="headerImage" id="r1sp1" src="http://c.na12.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=015U0000003sxfg&amp;oid=00DU0000000YT3c" /></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td style="background-color: #ffffff; beditid: r2st1; blabel: accent1; height: 0;"></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td styleinsert="1" height="300" style="background-color: #ffffff; beditid: r3st1; color: #000000; blabel: main; font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400">
<tbody>
<tr valign="top" height="400">
<td teditid="c1r1" style="background-color: #ffffff; beditid: r3st1; color: #000000; blabel: main; font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;" aeditid="c1r1" locked="0">
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">欢迎访问英特尔客户支持服务请求管理系统！</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"> </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">请保留此电子邮件以供日后参考。 </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"> </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><b>登录 ID：</b>!%UserUserName%!</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><b>电子邮件地址：</b>!%UserEmailAddr%! </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"> </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><b>需要执行的操作 </b></span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"> </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">请点击此<a href="https://signinpp.intel.com!%ActivationURL%!&amp;culture=zh">链接</a>或将该 URL 复制到浏览器以验证电子邮件地址。 </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"> </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">您的密码应该作为机密信息谨慎保护。 您对密码和英特尔网站的使用受英特尔使用条款与条件的制约。每个站点的网页底部均有使用条款与条件的链接。 </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"> </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">如果您有任何问题，请从<a href="http://http://www.intel.com/p/zh_CN/support">这里</a>与我们取得联系。 </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"> </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">在任何时间都可以通过访问此<a href="http://https://!%tst_us_en%!">链接</a>对您的配置文件进行管理。 </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"> </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">请不要回复此电子邮件。 这是一个自动回复。</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">为了确保能继续收到我们的邮件，请将我们添加至您的地址簿。 </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"> </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;">英特尔标识英特尔致力于保护您的隐私。 有关更多信息，</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;">请参阅<a href="http://http://www.intel.cn/content/www/cn/zh/privacy/intel-online-privacy-notice-summary.html">英特尔隐私声明</a>。 </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;"> </span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;"><a href="http://http://www.intel.cn/content/www/cn/zh/legal/terms-of-use.html">法律信息</a> | <a href="http://http://www.intel.cn/content/www/cn/zh/legal/trademarks.html">商标</a> © 英特尔公司。 保留所有权利。</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;">*文中涉及的其它名称及商标属于各自所有者资产。</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;" class="MsoNoSpacing"><span face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: xx-small;">**英特尔对公司内部网以外网站的内容不承担任何责任。 </span></p>
</td>
